From: Zamlet project
Subject: Apply SDF TIMESCALE when annotating delays

Icarus parses the SDF TIMESCALE header but otherwise ignores it. Convert SDF
delay values into each destination module's Verilog time unit before passing
them to vpi_put_delays.

diff --git a/ivtest/ivltests/sdf1.v b/ivtest/ivltests/sdf1.v
--- a/ivtest/ivltests/sdf1.v
+++ b/ivtest/ivltests/sdf1.v
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 `celldefine
-//`timescale 1ns / 1ps
+`timescale 1ns / 1ps
 
 // Description : 2 input XOR
 
